<td id="A2.T1.2.1.24.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b">Damper constant <math id="A2.T1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A2.T1.2.1.24.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b">-</td>
<td id="A2.T1.2.1.24.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b">-</td>
<td id="A2.T1.2.1.24.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b">-</td>
<td id="A2.T1.2.1.24.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b">-</td>
<td id="A2.T1.2.1.24.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b">1</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</span></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Training parameters for all the experiments.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>CARTerpillar Additional Results</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In the following, we report the detailed results of CDPO and PPOwEnt for different CARTerpillar configurations. In particular, we evaluate their performances for five <math id="A3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{reg}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{reg}</annotation></semantics></math> values: <math id="A3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[1\text{e-}1,3\text{e-}2,1\text{e-}2,3\text{e-}3,1\text{e-}3]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>e-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>e-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>e-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>e-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>e-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[1\text{e-}1,3\text{e-}2,1\text{e-}2,3\text{e-}3,1\text{e-}3]</annotation></semantics></math>. For 6, 7, and 8 carts (Figures <a href="#A3.F10" title="Figure 10 ‣ Appendix C CARTerpillar Additional Results ‣ Complexity-Driven Policy Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>, <a href="#A3.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ Appendix C CARTerpillar Additional Results ‣ Complexity-Driven Policy Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>, and <a href="#A3.F12" title="Figure 12 ‣ Appendix C CARTerpillar Additional Results ‣ Complexity-Driven Policy Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>, respectively), all <math id="A3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{reg}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{reg}</annotation></semantics></math> values reach the optimum in the case of CDPO, while some of them struggle in the case of PPOwEnt. The same holds for 9 carts (Figure <a href="#A3.F13" title="Figure 13 ‣ Appendix C CARTerpillar Additional Results ‣ Complexity-Driven Policy Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>), where a too-high entropy coefficient can make the agent unlearn optimal strategies. Finally, only a well-tuned coefficient can make PPOwEnt converge for 10 and 11 carts (Figures <a href="#A3.F14" title="Figure 14 ‣ Appendix C CARTerpillar Additional Results ‣ Complexity-Driven Policy Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a> and <a href="#A3.F15" title="Figure 15 ‣ Appendix C CARTerpillar Additional Results ‣ Complexity-Driven Policy Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>), while CDPO is able to converge with multiple <math id="A3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{reg}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{reg}</annotation></semantics></math> values. This greater robustness to variations in <math id="A3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{reg}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{reg}</annotation></semantics></math> is demonstrated in Figure <a href="#A3.F16" title="Figure 16 ‣ Appendix C CARTerpillar Additional Results ‣ Complexity-Driven Policy Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a>, which presents the mean and standard error of the aggregated results for all evaluated cart numbers.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.F10" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.20509v1/combined_plot_ComplexCartPoleEnv9.81_6.png" id="A3.F10.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/162;" width="548" height="162" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span>Mean episode reward for CARTerpillar with <math id="A3.F10.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C=6" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C=6</annotation></semantics></math> carts for CDPO (left) and PPOwEnt (right) with different <math id="A3.F10.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{reg}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{reg}</annotation></semantics></math> values. Each plot reports the mean and standard error over 3 seeds.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F11" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.20509v1/combined_plot_ComplexCartPoleEnv9.81_7.png" id="A3.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/176;" width="548" height="176" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11: </span>Mean episode reward for CARTerpillar with <math id="A3.F11.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C=7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C=7</annotation></semantics></math> carts for CDPO (left) and PPOwEnt (right) with different <math id="A3.F11.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{reg}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{reg}</annotation></semantics></math> values. Each plot reports the mean and standard error over 3 seeds.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F12" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.20509v1/combined_plot_ComplexCartPoleEnv9.81_8.png" id="A3.F12.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/162;" width="548" height="162" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 12: </span>Mean episode reward for CARTerpillar with <math id="A3.F12.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C=8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C=8</annotation></semantics></math> carts for CDPO (left) and PPOwEnt (right) with different <math id="A3.F12.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{reg}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{reg}</annotation></semantics></math> values. Each plot reports the mean and standard error over 3 seeds.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F13" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.20509v1/combined_plot_ComplexCartPoleEnv9.81_9.png" id="A3.F13.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/162;" width="548" height="162" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 13: </span>Mean episode reward for CARTerpillar with <math id="A3.F13.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C=9" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C=9</annotation></semantics></math> carts for CDPO (left) and PPOwEnt (right) with different <math id="A3.F13.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{reg}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{reg}</annotation></semantics></math> values. Each plot reports the mean and standard error over 3 seeds.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F14" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.20509v1/combined_plot_ComplexCartPoleEnv9.81_10.png" id="A3.F14.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/162;" width="548" height="162" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 14: </span>Mean episode reward for CARTerpillar with <math id="A3.F14.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C=10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C=10</annotation></semantics></math> carts for CDPO (left) and PPOwEnt (right) with different <math id="A3.F14.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{reg}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{reg}</annotation></semantics></math> values. Each plot reports the mean and standard error over 3 seeds.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F15" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.20509v1/combined_plot_ComplexCartPoleEnv9.81_11.png" id="A3.F15.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/162;" width="548" height="162" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 15: </span>Mean episode reward for CARTerpillar with <math id="A3.F15.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C=11" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C=11</annotation></semantics></math> carts for CDPO (left) and PPOwEnt (right) with different <math id="A3.F15.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{reg}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{reg}</annotation></semantics></math> values. Each plot reports the mean and standard error over 3 seeds.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.F16" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.20509v1/meta_avg_plot_subplots_CARTerpillar.png" id="A3.F16.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/313;" width="548" height="313" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 16: </span>Aggregated results for CDPO and PPOwEnt over different <math id="A3.F16.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{reg}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{reg}</annotation></semantics></math> values for the CARTerpillar environment with varying number of carts. Each plot reports the mean and standard error over 3 seeds.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
